  "body": "This home is a plaster home constructed in 2000, it does not have a Code Compliance Certificate (CCC). The home is being sold in its current no CCC state. The home has a bank mortgage and insurance. \r\n\r\nPlease note viewings are by private appointment only. General advice and mortgage broking assistance is available, please call Siyuan Guo on 0225220377. \r\n\r\nFor 15 years this comfortable family home with a beautifully maintained garden and amazing local views has been well loved and peacefully enjoyed by its long-time owners. The current owners are downsizing, creating a rare opportunity for a lucky family to own and enjoy this fantastic home.\r\n\r\nBest features of the home include:\r\n* Extra Large Double Garage + Workshop Area\r\n* 2x Walk-in Separate Storage Closets + Huge Under Stair Storage\r\n* 2x Large Lounges, one in each level\r\n* 2x Balconies with Panoramic Long Bay & Rangitoto Views\r\n* North facing all day sun\r\n* 4x Off Street Parking Spaces\r\n* Rooftop Solar Panels + Battery System Included\r\n\r\nBest features of the garden include:\r\n* Fully landscaped and paved for easy maintenance\r\n* Fenced along 3 sides, with potential to fully fence & gate.\r\n* Lovingly tended fruit trees in the garden: Olive x1, Mandarin x1, Cumquat x1, Feijoa x2, Lime x1.\r\n\r\nBest features of the location include:\r\n* Bus Stop just on Ian Sage Ave less than 1min away\r\n* 10min drive to Albany Mall & Albany Park and Ride\r\n* Short walk to Long Bay Beach, Waiake Beach, Long Bay Primary School, and Long Bay College\r\n* Short walk to every convenience including local tennis club, shops, hairdressers, cafes, cafes, restaurants, fish & chips shop, 2x medical clinics, 4 Square and more.\r\n\r\nIn the school zone for :\r\n* Long Bay Primary School - 5min walk\r\n* Long Bay College - 5min walk\r\n* Northcross Intermediate School - 5min drive\r\n\r\nPlease get in touch with Siyuan Guo on 0225220377 or Yimin Guo on 0224741325 for more information and to book a private viewing.\r\n\r\nAll conjunctions welcome.",
